[Black "White to play and win"]
[Result "1-0"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "8/8/1KP5/3r4/8/8/8/k7 w - - 0 1"]

{The pawn is a step from queening, but the rook keeps checking.} 1. c7 Rd6+ 2.
Kb5 (2. Kc5 Rd1 {and ...Rc1 stops the pawn.}) 2... Rd5+ 3. Kb4 Rd4+ 4. Kb3 Rd3+
5. Kc2 Rd4 {Black's last trick.} 6. c8=R $1 (6. c8=Q $2 Rc4+ 7. Qxc4 {and it's
stalemate.}) 6... Ra4 7. Kb3 {The rook is attacked and Rc1# is threatened.} 1-0
